	(text "Solder pins to the power board under the module: G/KS interleaved. The module\nNTC is NOT on this card: plain analog line to the CELL AN2/AN3 on the power board. Drain sense on its own pin (module DC+), spaced for 1000 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 267.216 0)
		(effects
